# ------------------------------
*.njsproj
*.ntvs*
*.sw?

# Visual Studio publish user settings
*.pubxml.user

# Azure / Visual Studio deployment files
**/Properties/PublishProfiles/
**/Properties/ServiceDependencies/

# Visual Studio Code local settings
.vscode/